---
import Placeholder from './Placeholder.astro';
import { site, privacyHref } from '../data/site';
import { signupConfig } from '../data/signup.config';
const privacy = privacyHref(import.meta.env.BASE_URL);
---
<section class="section faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="section-rule"></div>
    <h2 id="faq-title" class="display h2 c-text" data-reveal>Questions</h2>
    <dl class="faq-list c-text" data-reveal-group>
      <div data-reveal>
        <dt>What is Anybody Is Genius?</dt>
        <dd>
          An AI teacher for adults. You choose what you want to understand. It checks what you
          already know, teaches one step past it, asks you to do the thinking, and brings ideas
          back over time. It isn’t a course library, and it isn’t a chatbot that just hands you
          answers.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <dt>Who is it for?</dt>
        <dd>
          Adults who want to understand things properly, whether they’re starting from nothing
          or already know a field well. It starts wherever you are.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <dt>Is the demo above the real app?</dt>
        <dd>
          No. It’s a fixed example, written in advance and checked against published sources, to
          show the idea: one question taught at five depths. The app will find your level and
          adjust as you go, rather than pick from five set answers.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <dt>When does it launch?</dt>
        <dd>
          Early access opens {site.launchDate ?? <Placeholder label="launch date" />}. People on
          the list get the first invitations.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal>
        <dt>What happens to my email?</dt>
        <dd>
          We use it for one thing: early access. {signupConfig.doubleOptIn ? 'After a one-time confirmation email, you’ll get' : 'You’ll get'}
          one email when your invitation is ready, and at most one short note a month before
          then. We don’t sell it or share it
          with advertisers. Every email has an unsubscribe link, and the
          <a href={privacy}>privacy policy</a> has the details.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-list { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 5); max-width: 33em; }
  .faq-list > div { padding-block: calc(var(--u) * 3); border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .faq-list > div:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  dt { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: var(--s-24); line-height: calc(var(--u) * 4); text-wrap: balance; }
  dd { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 1); text-wrap: pretty; }
</style>
